id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29789::$$$message_0216_0000_0000$$$::And then, the last night ends.[lr]::
29790::$$$message_0216_0000_0001$$$::Abnormal returns to normal,[lr]::
29791::$$$message_0216_0000_0002$$$::the war draws to a close,[lr]::
29792::$$$message_0216_0000_0003$$$::and things that couldn't exist return to their original nothingness.::
29793::$$$message_0216_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29794::$$$message_0216_0001_0001$$$::In thirty seconds, the clock will reach midnight.[lr]::
29795::$$$message_0216_0001_0002$$$::Once that happens, the fourth day will completely die.[lr]::
29796::$$$message_0216_0001_0003$$$::All the past time will be lost once the date rolls over.[lr]::
29797::$$$message_0216_0001_0004$$$::The end.[lr]::
29798::$$$message_0216_0001_0005$$$::Once I wake, I'll probably be back in my normal life.::
29799::$$$message_0216_0002_0000$$$::The Holy Grail War is over.[lr]::
29800::$$$message_0216_0002_0001$$$::The war had no victor,[lr]::
29801::$$$message_0216_0002_0002$$$::the mystery remains unsolved,[lr]::
29802::$$$message_0216_0002_0003$$$::and the hollow paradise continues turning, even now.::
{